          "content": "# trivectorlabs.ai - Forex MT5 Execution\\n\\nReceives a risk-approved trade proposal from the Signal & Risk Gate.\\n\\nDefault behavior is paper execution. Replace placeholder HTTP nodes with real MT5 Bridge API calls only after demo testing and risk review."
        }
